- Restored `root_hash_algo_id` to the Superblock (Section 4).
- Restored distinct backup copies for Config Snapshot, Meta/User Table, and Function Table (Section 12) — previously only Superblock and the Parity Block had real redundancy.
- Pinned down the LBA4–5 fallback pointer field layout (Section 3.2/3.3).
- Stated the config_self_checksum algorithm (xxhash64) and a 4080-byte bound on the stripped TOML (Section 5).
